Design Name     : avs_system_top (Closed-Loop AVS Power Macro)
Process PDK     : SkyWater 130nm High-Density (Sky130A)
Nominal Clock   : 75.0 MHz Core (T_clk = 13.33 ns) | 12.5 MHz Controller (T_ctrl = 80.0 ns)
Sign-Off Method : Multi-Corner Multi-Mode (MCMM) with Back-Annotated Post-Route SPEF & SPICE Calibration
Sign-Off Date   : Sun Nov 22 2026
========================================================================================================

